        "original_id": "78d4d8fd-dee2-5113-b5ab-be6e9bffca56",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Beldon Katleman\n- Places: Las Vegas Strip, Paradise, Nevada, United States\n- Products: Frontier Hotel, Silver Slipper, New Frontier Hotel and Casino, Last Frontier, The Frontier\n- Topics: casino investment, hotel and casino operations\n\nFacts:\n- The New Frontier Hotel and Casino, formerly known as Last Frontier and The Frontier, was a hotel and casino on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada, United States.\n- The New Frontier Hotel and Casino was the second resort to open on the Las Vegas Strip.\n- The New Frontier Hotel and Casino operated continuously from October 30, 1942, until it closed on July 16, 2007.\n- Beldon Katleman was an investor in two other casinos, the Frontier Hotel and the Silver Slipper.",
